<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Spider-Man</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#0a0a0a;color:white;text-align:center}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b00000,#001a8f);padding:60px 20px}
.hero h1{font-size:45px;margin:0}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;padding:12px 25px;background:white;color:#b00000;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;border-radius:30px}
.cards{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:15px;padding:20px}
.card{background:#1a1a1a;border:1px solid #333;border-radius:15px;width:280px;padding:20px}
.card h3{color:#ff2a2a}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="hero">
<h1>SPIDER-MAN</h1>
<p>With great power comes great responsibility.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#about">Enter The Spider-Verse</a>
</div>
<div class="cards" id="about">
<div class="card"><h3>Powers</h3><p>Super strength, wall-crawling, spider-sense</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Origin</h3><p>Bitten by a radioactive spider</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>City</h3><p>Protecting Queens and New York</p></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
